  downloads the official, unmodified PawnIO installer and runs it. PawnIO is a
  separate program with its own license set by its author; it is neither
  linked into nor derived from Lagnix, so it does not affect Lagnix's license.
  If you redistribute the installer yourself, do so unmodified and check the
  terms at the links above first.

